---
description: Modular monolith conventions under app/Modules
globs: app/Modules/**/*.php,bootstrap/providers.php
---

# Modules

- One capability per module under `app/Modules/{Name}`
- Register `{Name}ServiceProvider` in `bootstrap/providers.php`
- Load migrations with `loadMigrationsFrom`; routes with an `api` + `api` prefix group and module `v1/...` routes
- Providers must not migrate, call the network, or perform destructive boot work
- Cross-module state changes go through a documented public Action/service
- Example module is a demo pattern, not product domain
- Identity owns auth/profile; canonical user model stays `App\Models\User`
